## Independent negative controls

| Replacement setup | Classification | Auto-applies under this grant? |
|---|---|---|
| The row originates in the ticket | Redraw; the drafted-row correction exception does not authorize rewriting ticket AC text | **No** |
| Only reviewer taste supports the correction; no implementer evidence | Redraw; this is a reviewer-only/taste objection, not the evidenced drafted-row exception | **No** |
| Add or remove an AC row | Redraw | **No** |
| Change the problem statement | Redraw | **No** |
| Add a component or alter a component boundary | Redraw | **No** |

Each control stops at the redraw gate before applying any sibling amendments. `auto-apply amends` never authorizes a redraw or substitutes for renewed design approval.
